AUUUUGUUUUCUUUGGAUUCU&UGACCCACCUCCUGGAAUGACCUUAAAUGAGAAGAGUGUUCAAAAUUCAAUUACACAGUGGAUUGUAGACAUGGAAGGUGCACCAGGUACCUUAUAUGAAGGGGAAAAAUUUCAACUUCUAUUUAAAUUUAGUAGUCGAUAUCCUUUUGACUCUCCUCAGGUCAUGUUUACUGGUGAAAAUAUUCCUGUUCAUCCUCAUGUUUAUAGCAAUGGUCAUAUCUGUUUAUCCAUUC\
